text_output=I think Mike had talked about the GitHub coders. Maybe we didn't talk about it today. We've been talking about it a lot after the Microsoft meeting, Google meetings about what's their target for an agentic box, and so that's a very targeted usage for each segment or deployment we expect a customer to target there.
